episode.description:
Louis is joined in our brand-new studio by writer, documentarian and creative doppelganger Jon Ronson. Jon tells Louis all about delving into culture wars, how public shaming has created a ‘superbug’ of shamelessness, and the cast of ‘unravelling men’ in his new book, The Castle.&nbsp;&nbsp;

&nbsp;

Warnings: Strong language and adult themes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

